The user sent `module_name: "RMS_ANALYTICS"` directly — this is NOT `"GLOBAL"`, so it should have gone into the `elif raw.endswith("_ANALYTICS")` branch, passed the collection check, and then downstream the graph selection should have picked `get_analytics_graph()`.

